  "human_scope_review": "Owner-approved nine sequential SMS analysis and reliability corrections, single PR Draft. No financial write without original approval, verified account and source timestamp. OTP and permission safety remain. Registered tests before production. Owner approved M1031 (#750) for shared review classification/status and explicit human confirmation; unattended posting retains strict checks. QA reconciliation for M473/M470/M336/M300/M506/M620/M486/M303 and two UI preservation tests: use current native-id hash and encrypted post-commit receipt, keep all tests enabled. M1032 user-approved outgoing bank-SMS owner-review correction: field-specific refusal reason, no hard blocker from secondary heuristic parser, strict original SAR/date/direction/leaf checks.",
  "user_requested_changes": [
    "M1032 issue #751 fix screenshot of SAR 1900 outgoing transfer confirmation and close 12 identified cross-feature gaps inside one Draft PR",
    "1. Re-evaluate pending SMS when approved rules or accounts become available/changed, without duplicate finance",
    "2. Require notification delivery confirmation before marking a review attempt complete",
    "3. AutoPost must require verified transaction timestamp instead of arrival-time fallback",
    "4. Protect distinct same-text transactions while deduping exact re-delivery",
    "5. Offer explicitly-consented full SMS history scan with bounded cursor",
    "6. Mask only OTP digits in mixed SMS while retaining amount/date/suffix safely",
    "7. Recover encrypted pending SMS after terminal Worker error without busy loops",
    "8. Do not concatenate independent multipart SMS only because sender matches",
    "9. Avoid synchronous encrypted queue I/O on BroadcastReceiver main thread",
    "10. M1031 unify SMS review suggestions/notification states and allow verified explicit owner confirmation of external outgoing expenses without AutoPost authority",
    "11. M1031 persist owner-scoped encrypted post-commit learning evidence for manual/SMS income/expense and prevent conflicting learned financial directions",
    "12. M1031 accurately display per-source verified encrypted learning events alongside distinct count of reusable matching rules",
    "12. Fix all 11 CI failing legacy positive source contracts on PR #749 without weakening SAR currency gate, verified SMS v2 identity, post-commit learning or ACK safety.",
    "M1032 Stage 3/4/11: account-linked delete+undo atomic archive, recurring-bound account archive guard and safe verified no-receipt Delete All account links",
    "M1032 stages 5 and 7: idempotent reversing transfer with verified two-account posting, local-rule-kind review notifications in background"
  ],
